# DIAGNOSTICS

`CROI_ERR_BAD_HANDLE`, `CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE` and `CROI_ERR_ACCESS_DENIED` as for any handle; see syscall(2).
`CROI_ERR_OUT_OF_RANGE`: the resource does not grant POWER; `CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE` if it is of another kind.
`CROI_ERR_NO_MEMORY`: no memory for the table.

